flowchart TD
  Reel[Approved reel data] --> Scene[Animation scene spec]
  VisualBible[Visual bible assets] --> Scene
  Narration[Narration audio] --> Timing[Narration timing]
  Timing --> LipSync[Optional Rhubarb mouth cues]
  Scene --> Remotion[Remotion composition]
  Timing --> Remotion
  LipSync -.-> Remotion
  Captions[Caption timings] --> Remotion
  Remotion --> Video[Animated MP4]
  Video --> Validate[FFmpeg / FFprobe validation]
  Validate --> Manifest[Manifest and checksums]
  Manifest --> Review[Studio asset review]
